\ crypto/keccak.fam — Keccak-f[1600] and the SHA-3 functions of tabminer's
\ miner/src/keccak.rs (FIPS 202): SHAKE128, SHAKE256, SHA3-256 and
\ SHA3-512, for Dilithium (crypto/dilithium.fam) and Kyber.  A module: a
\ program names it (`\ uses: crypto/keccak.fam`, scripts/build.sh).  One
\ sponge at a time: kcinit, kcabs any number of times, then kcsqz any
\ number of times.
\
\ kcinit ( rate suffix -- )  a new sponge: rate bytes (A8 SHAKE128, 88
\ SHAKE256 and SHA3-256, 48 SHA3-512), the suffix 1F (SHAKE) or 6 (SHA-3).
\ kcabs ( src len -- )  bytes absorbed (none after squeezing began).
\ kcsqz ( dst len -- )  bytes squeezed; again for the ones after.
\ shake128 ( src len dst dlen -- )  dlen bytes of SHAKE128 at dst;
\ shake256 likewise.  sha3256 ( src len dst -- )  32 bytes at dst;
\ sha3512 ( src len dst -- )  64.

: kcst variable ;  : kcrc variable ;  : kcr variable ;  : kcp variable ;  : kcsq variable ;  : kcsf variable ;
: kcd variable ;  : kcdl variable ;

\ kcraw ( st rc -- )  the permutation, raw, on the 25 lanes at st (each
\ two words, the low first, so the 200 bytes are in FIPS 202's order),
\ with the 24 round constants at rc.  From tools/gendilithium.py through
\ tools/asm2fam.py.
: kcraw
83220100 ,   \ lw t0,0(sp)   ( rc )
83204100 ,   \ lw ra,4(sp)   ( st )
1383020C ,   \ addi t1,t0,192
23226100 ,   \ sw t1,4(sp)   ( rc's end )
